                    <span class="entry-period">Apr 2025 – Jun 2025</span>
                    <span class="entry-period">Remote, Bulgaria</span>
                </div>
                <div class="entry-body">
                    <h3 class="entry-title">Front End Intern</h3>
                    <p class="entry-desc">Enhanced e-commerce front-end using HTML, CSS/Bootstrap, JavaScript, and Shopify Liquid. Shipped new features, resolved UI bugs, and owned ongoing front-end maintenance.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="entry-row">
